  "description": "Weighing in at around 3 pounds, the Carver Carbo’Beast aims to offer a diet fatbike frame at the same insane Carver value you’ve all come to know. Titanium may be our bread and butter, but carbon has a place in the fatbike world as well. When quick power transfer and stiffness are required, the Carbo’Beast is the fatbike frame to choose. Like most of our frames, versatility is built in. A variety of tire sizes and wheel diameters will comfortably fit in the Carbo’Beast.\n\nThe Carbo’Beast has had a few iterations over the years, so frame aesthetics and geometry may vary slightly. We encourage you to reach out and start the discussion on the particulars of which frames are available and will work the best for you.",
